    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/fresh-bakers/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Fresh Bakers is a stylish and versatile theme designed for bakeries, pastry shops, and cake boutiques. With a clean, modern layout, it beautifully showcases baked goods like artisan bread, cupcakes, muffins, cookies, birthday cakes, and gluten-free treats. The theme includes features such as an integrated online store, customizable menus, and options for delivery, takeout, or wholesale inquiries. Fully responsive and easy to personalize, it helps create an inviting, professional online presence that looks great on any device. Ideal for bakery website, sweet shop, online cake delivery, patisserie, chocolate store, doughnut shop, and dessert cafe, this free template works seamlessly with the WooCommerce plugin for selling baked products and accepting orders online."
    },
